export const TREO = "## Phiên \"dbeaver\": BEGIN + UPDATE rồi bỏ đi ăn trưa\n## API: duyệt lượt 42 (curl -m 5)\n$ curl -s -m 5 -X POST 127.0.0.1:41710/dat-lich/42/duyet\n\ncurl exit 28\n## Ai đang chờ ai?\nSELECT pid, application_name AS app, state, wait_event_type AS wt, wait_event,\n       pg_blocking_pids(pid) AS bi_chan_boi, now() - xact_start AS tx_mo, left(query, 60) AS query\nFROM pg_stat_activity WHERE datname = 'labflow' AND pid &lt;&gt; pg_backend_pid() AND backend_type = 'client backend'\nORDER BY xact_start NULLS LAST;\n pid |   app   |        state        |   wt   |  wait_event   | bi_chan_boi |      tx_mo      |                            query                             \n-----+---------+---------------------+--------+---------------+-------------+-----------------+--------------------------------------------------------------\n 647 | dbeaver | idle in transaction | Client | ClientRead    | {}          | 00:00:06.012831 | UPDATE \"DatLich\" SET \"soGio\" = 3 WHERE id = 42;\n 648 |         | active              | Lock   | transactionid | {647}       | 00:00:05.042609 | UPDATE \"public\".\"DatLich\" SET \"trangThai\" = $1 WHERE (\"publi\n(2 rows)\n\nSELECT l.pid, l.locktype, l.relation::regclass AS bang, l.transactionid AS xid, l.mode, l.granted\nFROM pg_locks l JOIN pg_stat_activity a ON a.pid = l.pid\nWHERE a.datname = 'labflow' AND a.pid &lt;&gt; pg_backend_pid() AND l.locktype IN ('relation', 'transactionid', 'tuple')\n  AND (l.relation IS NULL OR l.relation = '\"DatLich\"'::regclass)\nORDER BY l.granted DESC, l.pid;\n pid |   locktype    |   bang    | xid  |       mode       | granted \n-----+---------------+-----------+------+------------------+---------\n 647 | transactionid |           | 1549 | ExclusiveLock    | t\n 647 | relation      | \"DatLich\" |      | RowExclusiveLock | t\n 648 | tuple         | \"DatLich\" |      | ExclusiveLock    | t\n 648 | transactionid |           | 1550 | ExclusiveLock    | t\n 648 | relation      | \"DatLich\" |      | RowExclusiveLock | t\n 648 | transactionid |           | 1549 | ShareLock        | f\n(6 rows)\n\n## Log của PostgreSQL (log_lock_waits = on, deadlock_timeout = 1s)\n2026-11-23 22:57:48.658 UTC [648] LOG:  process 648 still waiting for ShareLock on transaction 1549 after 1000.064 ms\n2026-11-23 22:57:48.658 UTC [648] DETAIL:  Process holding the lock: 647. Wait queue: 648.\n2026-11-23 22:57:48.658 UTC [648] CONTEXT:  while updating tuple (25,4) in relation \"DatLich\"\n2026-11-23 22:57:48.658 UTC [648] STATEMENT:  UPDATE \"public\".\"DatLich\" SET \"trangThai\" = $1 WHERE (\"public\".\"DatLich\".\"id\" = $2 AND 1=1) RETURNING \"public\".\"DatLich\".\"id\", \"public\".\"DatLich\".\"phongId\", \"public\".\"DatLich\".\"nguoiId …";
